<title>USA: FREE-TO-TRADE - Utah Hsg Fin. Agency, $25 mln.</title>
<headline>FREE-TO-TRADE - Utah Hsg Fin. Agency, $25 mln.</headline>
<text>
<p>UTAH HOUSING FINANCE AGENCY</p>
<p>RE: $25,000,000</p>
<p>SINGLE FAMILY MORTGAGE BONDS</p>
<p>1997 ISSUE A</p>
<p>(FEDERALLY INSURED OR GUARANTEED MORTGAGE LOANS)</p>
<p>Effective immediately all syndicate terms and price restrictions are removed and the bonds are free to trade.</p>
<p>Goldman, Sachs &amp; Co.</p>
<p>First Security Bank</p>
<p>Zions First National Bank Capital Markets</p>
<p>George K. Baum &amp; Company</p>
<p>U.S. Municipal Desk, 212-859-1650</p>
